<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Kaucuk H1 gross profit falls.</title>
<headline>Czech Kaucuk H1 gross profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	    443.381   vs     1,192.843</p>
<p>Sales of own</p>
<p> goods and services  3,196.070   vs     7,165.865</p>
<p> Operating profit	437.918   vs     1,236.981</p>
<p> Production	    3,195.762   vs     7,657.686</p>
<p> Total assets	  9,401.731   vs    11,468.773</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Kaucuk Group a.s.. The firm is one of the country's largest chemical concerns. Kaucuk divested its refinery division at the beginning of this year under a government refinery privatisation plan. Its shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
